」が結ばれてラブラブエッチしているシーンをお願いします。\n体位や構図などはお任せします。\n\n絵柄はなるべく公式に寄せてください。\n\n【その他・運命に関して】\n華奢な体躯\n陰毛はなし\n服装の着脱もお任せしますが、頭部の髪飾りは残してください。\n\n【参考資料】\n〇「運命」の参考資料\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/10Bbai4gPCU1h1Pl4RoPsp4erkmNwypsc?usp=drive_link\n〇「朝雛タクト」の参考資料\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1tVazpO4a588p2_106nqfXsTfAUK2k8YG?usp=drive_link\n\n\nよろしくお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@aizakib_2626/works/65", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8b225bb6/uploads/origins/2db9a647-90bb-4a74-b82a-8e10cb1874b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=36a98f91f3742963c73893d57a4bb8a8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8b225bb6/uploads/origins/2db9a647-90bb-4a74-b82a-8e10cb1874b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=36a98f91f3742963c73893d57a4bb8a8, https://si.imgix.net/8b225bb6/uploads/origins/2db9a647-90bb-4a74-b82a-8e10cb1874b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6a2518c97592f34ec52ebf21740854c7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8b225bb6/uploads/origins/2db9a647-90bb-4a74-b82a-8e10cb1874b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=63c3cb6b99c27451be471df3991b865c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！\nあなたの作品を見て、とても興味を持ちました！\n私のためにキャラクターを描いてくれたらとても嬉しいです！https://imgur.com/a/QnWwVlF\n\nできればサングラス(アビエイター？)をかけて、赤とゴールドを基調としたスタイリッシュで大人っぽい夏服/水着を探しています！できればサングラス(アビエイター?)付きで！これにちょっと似てるかも(帽子なし): https://imgur.com/a/l63PM9g\n\n服装は自由に変更してください！\n\nこのゴールドのヘアアクセサリーとヘアスタイルもお願いします。https://imgur.com/a/BfAdPb3\n\nご配慮ありがとうございました！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@aizakib_2626/works/64", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/49bdb379/uploads/origins/4da01519-e242-49e2-9371-b7fdedb36db0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bcf074c9f0b342f476bc5ba1b1bc67ca", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/49bdb379/uploads/origins/4da01519-e242-49e2-9371-b7fdedb36db0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bcf074c9f0b342f476bc5ba1b1bc67ca, https://si.imgix.net/49bdb379/uploads/origins/4da01519-e242-49e2-9371-b7fdedb36db0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c63d35ee2b2b900f4c64a8af673b5c98 2x, https://si.imgix.net/49bdb379/uploads/origins/4da01519-e242-49e2-9371-b7fdedb36db0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4c996353a64df893328203f049cbb9ac 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "こんにちは！\nオリジナルキャラクターを依頼したいです。\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Q_hP8X7VX0G06aNuOoxqowoFoOLfVbtu?usp=sharing\n\nポーズ参考\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/102523548\n(ポーズの詳細は変更可能です）\n\n- 教室にて\n- 机に手を置く\n- 衣著完整\n- 恥ずかしそうな顔、期待感\n\n差分\n- 後背立位\n\n服装\n- 半脫、おっぱいが見える、\nスカートを脱ぐ、ズボンを片足に下ろす\n\n顔\n- 衝撃顔\n- 輕微高潮、失神\n- オーガズム顔\n- 余韻に浸る顔\n\n問題があれば却下OK\nまたリクエスト確認します～！\nありがとうございました！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@aizakib_2626/works/63", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/30efa345/uploads/origins/61bf3501-e7ae-4900-b8f2-041f2cf07620?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3f3e45a8079a9d8a7196b3c6bfbe3d19", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/30efa345/uploads/origins/61bf3501-e7ae-4900-b8f2-041f2cf07620?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3f3e45a8079a9d8a7196b3c6bfbe3d19, https://si.imgix.net/30efa345/uploads/origins/61bf3501-e7ae-4900-b8f2-041f2cf07620?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e9cf2a1b83b7d8a5bca2472f3c2539f4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/30efa345/uploads/origins/61bf3501-e7ae-4900-b8f2-041f2cf07620?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=66851d1840b4d55ecdcae0edeaf5beac 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Thank you for the appeal! I would love if you could draw my vtuber Az.\nAz is a star bat that lives in space. She’s easy-going, playful, and mischievous.  She has star bat ears, pale hair that is tinted brighter blue at the ends and starry space bat wings. She can fly and likes to eat sweets/candy and also make portals. She can also use a bow made from cosmic energy. She can also turn into a bat.\n\nThe poses and everything is up to you. Also feel free to do anything with the outfit or design a new outfit for her. please keep her hair color, star ears and wings the same.  ^^ full creative freedom. If the amount is too low for what you would like to do then please appeal. It may be used on SNS with credit to you!\n\nThank you for your time and consideration!\n\nRef: https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1uOS5xmu_cY11yMigfro8jzPnliqxFdkh\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1uOS5xmu_cY11yMigfro8jzPnliqxFdkh", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@aizakib_2626/works/62", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f16f5348/uploads/origins/b0ac1b9f-fbe8-4d03-94a6-fdcf95fb8011?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e3d2acc04897bbbdb60b09fd3a987592", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f16f5348/uploads/origins/b0ac1b9f-fbe8-4d03-94a6-fdcf95fb8011?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e3d2acc04897bbbdb60b09fd3a987592, https://si.imgix.net/f16f5348/uploads/origins/b0ac1b9f-fbe8-4d03-94a6-fdcf95fb8011?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7484d9f2f149fde6bb6d12a9cea9ad91 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f16f5348/uploads/origins/b0ac1b9f-fbe8-4d03-94a6-fdcf95fb8011?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fdc01f7803632ef2d04a3f25c6f1ead5 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、アピールありがとうございます！あなたの絵はとても可愛いです🥰 私のキャラクターを好きなように描いてください。\n\nこの度はありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/193qYtCHzosGHtzdQJLgBkp2lGoK6NxT0?usp=share_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@aizakib_2626/works/61", "thumbnail_src": "https